{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-existence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d5e33a6084e677c2e6bdf879958e92c54d20252afa8bbb7950e66cf313fbb9d4", "source_text": "The base change of a morphism of algebraic stacks which satisfies the\nexistence part of the valuative criterion by any morphism of\nalgebraic stacks is a morphism of algebraic stacks which satisfies the\nexistence part of the valuative criterion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d72dae2f1757a85c821394556482cc1048fa89c6636774b6a53c43c99c75325d", "unit_id": "tag:0CLL:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-cat-dotted-arrows-base-change}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d46b0b613ef9eb9f2aca656e20aa768395749d9bbbe510821899c406e0e4d5df", "source_text": "Follows from Lemma <REF_0001>\nand the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:793206dd7e99089e45b201366436fa44bb9d49b38060509e3a3a8fad9bc33b2a", "unit_id": "tag:0CLL:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-existence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:788ea82a3817a7bb99325dcfc7edce0da0309ba684dc75e50991033edb14bdcd", "source_text": "The composition of morphisms of algebraic stacks which satisfy the\nexistence part of the valuative criterion is another\nmorphism of algebraic stacks which satisfies the\nexistence part of the valuative criterion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:337fe63e8edcc0f6cdd9d1842360035bbf9c115f0461f2c6175fadf3c2b004a2", "unit_id": "tag:0CLM:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-cat-dotted-arrows-composition}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:91994d02d40726e8d8fef4258be076300ddcffca7367ec28d7eafdc6133007d5", "source_text": "Follows from Lemma <REF_0001>\nand the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:793206dd7e99089e45b201366436fa44bb9d49b38060509e3a3a8fad9bc33b2a", "unit_id": "tag:0CLM:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0CL9", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$T$", "MATH_0004": "$T \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} T \\to T$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-existence-representable}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:5c06727e5d09152a1f637b38d18d9118294136d51708e2b39db58466864b5e29", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2a17f6e20ba9d35052d52cd2ae585a2d69c1130d11cffe5db03b79c79d6b6ed0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks\nwhich is representable by algebraic spaces. Then the following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> satisfies the existence part of the valuative criterion,\n<STRUCT_0003> for every scheme <MATH_0003> and morphism <MATH_0004>\nthe morphism <MATH_0005> satisfies\nthe existence part of the valuative criterion as a morphism\nof algebraic spaces.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d9358d938bf46d9a6f5e4f0753e839d8f849cfc2628028f9cf3ff7c8a1ac7327", "unit_id": "tag:0CLN:statement"}
